            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 21,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "There is no standard driver for JTAG protocol, how are you adding this support?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 156,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Please add related PRs as a section in comment description which adds supports in EM schema, configuration and phosphor-dbus-interfaces."
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/cpld_interface.hpp",
                    "line": 40,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you make this an enum?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/cpld_interface.hpp",
                    "line": 41,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Can this be a size_t?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/cpld_software_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 30,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Aren't these only _required_ for JTAG-based updates?  Are we updating all the existing schemas to add these?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/cpld_software_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 54,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "This is very surprising.  Why are we converting it _back_ to a string?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/lattice/lattice_base_cpld.cpp",
                    "line": 550,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Use a RAII class to ensure exceptions cannot cause file descriptor leaks.  You'll see an `I2C` class for exactly this purpose in `i2c.cpp`.  Make something similar for your purposes here."
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/lattice/lattice_base_cpld.cpp",
                    "line": 616,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Why aren't we using something like `mkstemp`?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/lattice/lattice_base_cpld.cpp",
                    "line": 640,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Again, use a RAII class so these things are automatically cleaned up and even handled in exception cases."
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/lattice/lattice_base_cpld.cpp",
                    "line": 646,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Why are we doing this?  You already depended on libgpiod.  Use it.  Don't shell out to some executable."
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/lattice/lattice_base_cpld.cpp",
                    "line": 666,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "What is this??  \"jam-player\"??  There is no executable."
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/lattice/lattice_xo3_cpld.cpp",
                    "line": 406,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you use std::format here?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "cpld/lattice/lattice_xo5_cpld.cpp",
                    "line": 399,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "use std::format."
                }
